: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 강좌기간 : </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2013. 10. 7.(월) ~ 10. 19.(토) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 강좌일시 : 평일 18시 ~ 22시 [단, 10/19(토) 10~14시]</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 시헙일시 : 2013. 10. 19(토) 15:00 ~ 16:30 </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(시험 반드시 응시해야함)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 강좌내용</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 강의계획서 참고<a href=\"http://linc.kumoh.ac.kr/facility/linc/page/subLocation.do?menu_no=30100401\" target=\"_blank\"><u><font color=\"#810081\">(LINC 홈페이지로가기)</font></u></a> ← 클릭</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -90.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 90.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 선발기준 : </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">선착순 30명 모집</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(단, 30명 미만시 강좌 취소)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -90.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 90.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 신청기간 : </span></span><sp